: basics
:
$* -V -LL <<EOI >'Hello'
#define GREETING Hello
GREETING
EOI

# Upstream's main() returns -2 when it cannot open the input file. Windows
# reports that as exit code 0xFFFFFFFE, which build2 treats as abnormal
# termination, so only check this on other platforms.
#
: missing-input
:
if ($c.target.class != 'windows')
{
  $* 'nonexistent' 2>>:~%EOE% != 0
  %.*nonexistent: .+%
  Can't open input file "nonexistent"
  EOE
}
